  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Children of Ukraine Survive the Winter</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In harsh winter conditions, millions of Ukrainians are still under attack or have fled their homes, seeking safety across the border. GFC has disbursed over $1.9 million to support 60+ of local organizations helping children and youth survive conflict and crisis. Your support this holiday season means that GFC can provide critical support to our partners whenever it is necessary. In a crisis situation, young people don&apos;t have weeks or months to wait for food, shelter, and security.</narrative>
  </description>
